6404..6480 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6481..6555 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6556..6632 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
